/Title (In this project, we developed and evaluated multiple Machine Learning models to predict user satisfaction based on learning platform data. The results show that the Random Forest model outperforms Linear Regression, achieving better performance . This confirms the importance of using more advanced models to capture complex and non-linear relationships in the data. Overall, our approach demonstrates how data-driven techniques can significantly improve understanding and decision-making in e-learning platforms.)
